# R390: the reality ledgers carry append-only REAL-event custody (Art.
# XXXVIII machine-enforcement). The first real event (EVT-R390-NIST-
# WATER-VISC-310K) makes them durable evidence — committed, like the
# R370U anchors. Hermetic tests redirect these paths (conftest guard),
# so only operator-intentional live runs (ENGINE_LIVE=1) can dirty them.
!premium_package_factory/output/reality_loop/
premium_package_factory/output/reality_loop/*
!premium_package_factory/output/reality_loop/REALITY_EVENT_LEDGER.jsonl
!premium_package_factory/output/reality_loop/CAUSAL_MUTATION_LEDGER.jsonl

